BT 1 0 0 1 0 65.8 Tm 12.5 TL /F2 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Based on the evidence reviewed, the land at 6 Bulwer Road is strongly associated with a locality historically) Tj T* (used and promoted for farming and agricultural purposes.) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( The modern title and deposited plan place the land in) Tj T* (the Parish of Bong Bong and in the Bulwer/Lytton Road area. The Austermere Estate material for this same historical) Tj T* (locality records land as cleared, ready for ploughing, and suitable for orchard, dairy and agricultural farms by 1904.) Tj T* (On that basis, the evidence supports the conclusion that the land formed part of a historically rural and agricultural) Tj T* (landscape and that clearing for farming/agricultural use had occurred in the area by at least 1904.) Tj T* ET
